  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The extensions, by virtue of their scale, siting, bulk and designs result in incongruous, visually intrusive and overbearing additions which significantly harm the character and appearance of the property, terraced row and the wider street scene. The extensions fail to comply with requirements made in Sections 3 and 4 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD Part A5 - Residential Extension Guidelines. The proposal is therefore considered to be contrary to adopted local plan policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations). "
